Value neighbor_id (\S+)
Value local_if_addr (\S+)
Value area (\d+)
Value interface (\S+)
Value priority (\d+)
Value state (\S+)
Value state_changes (\d+)
Value dr_ip (\S+)
Value bdr_ip (\S+)
Value hello_opts (0x[0-9a-fA-F]+)
Value hello_opts_desc ([^)]+)
Value dbd_opts (0x[0-9a-fA-F]+)
Value dbd_opts_desc ([^)]+)
Value lls_opts (0x[0-9a-fA-F]+)
Value lls_opts_desc ([^)]+)
Value dead_timer (\S+)
Value uptime (\S+)
Value index (\S+)
Value retrans_queue_len (\d+)
Value num_retrans (\d+)
Value first_seq (\S+)
Value next_seq (\S+)
Value retrans_scan_len (\d+)
Value retrans_scan_len_max (\d+)
Value retrans_scan_time (\d+)
Value retrans_scan_time_max (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*Neighbor ${neighbor_id}, interface address ${local_if_addr} -> Neighbor

Neighbor
  ^\s{4}In the area ${area} via interface ${interface}
  ^\s{4}Neighbor priority is ${priority}, State is ${state}, ${state_changes} state changes
  ^\s{4}DR is ${dr_ip} BDR is ${bdr_ip}
  ^\s{4}Options is ${hello_opts} in Hello \(${hello_opts_desc}\)
  ^\s{4}Options is ${dbd_opts} in DBD \(${dbd_opts_desc}\)
  ^\s{4}LLS Options is ${lls_opts} \(${lls_opts_desc}\)
  ^\s{4}Dead timer due in ${dead_timer}
  ^\s{4}Neighbor is up for ${uptime}
  ^\s{4}Index ${index}, retransmission queue length ${retrans_queue_len}, number of retransmission ${num_retrans}
  ^\s{4}First ${first_seq} Next ${next_seq}
  ^\s{4}Last retransmission scan length is ${retrans_scan_len}, maximum is ${retrans_scan_len_max}
  ^\s{4}Last retransmission scan time is ${retrans_scan_time} msec, maximum is ${retrans_scan_time_max} msec
  ^\s*Neighbor ${neighbor_id}, interface address ${local_if_addr} -> Record Neighbor